cff-version: 1.2.0
title: django-chainsaw-mcp
message: >-
  If you use this software or build on its ideas, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alsakka
    given-names: Mohammad
    email: mnouralsakka@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/syrian963/django-chainsaw-mcp"
abstract: >-
  An MCP server and CLI that analyses a Django project rather than describing
  it. It answers what a delete takes with it, where the N+1 queries are, which
  pending migration breaks the code that is still running during a rolling
  deploy, which queries read rows the caller does not own, and what a single
  save actually sets off.
keywords:
  - django
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - static-analysis
  - code-quality
  - orm
license: MIT
